{
  "video_id": "ee3sSOir43g",
  "title": "⚠️ Don't say 'Quiero' in a cafe! (Speak like a local) #Shorts",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-16 19:23:10",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.12,
      "en": "Ayer pedí un café y dije:",
      "zh": "我昨天去點咖啡時說了："
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.12,
      "end": 4.32,
      "en": "\"¡Quiero un latte!",
      "zh": "我昨天去點咖啡時說了：\n「我要一杯拿鐵！」"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.32,
      "end": 7.339,
      "en": "El barista se quedó congelado.",
      "zh": "結果咖啡師瞬間愣住，"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 7.339,
      "end": 8.119,
      "en": "No entendí nada.",
      "zh": "結果咖啡師瞬間愣住，\n我完全一頭霧水。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 9.099,
      "end": 11.64,
      "en": "Porque \"Quiero\" suena como una orden.",
      "zh": "因為用「Quiero（我要）」聽起來很像在下命令。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 12.019,
      "end": 13.8,
      "en": "Suena a exigir,",
      "zh": "聽起來像在要求對方，"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 13.8,
      "end": 14.419,
      "en": "no a pedir.",
      "zh": "聽起來像在要求對方，\n而不是在有禮貌地點餐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 15.539,
      "end": 16.879,
      "en": "¡Vaya!",
      "zh": "原來如此！"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 16.879,
      "end": 19.399,
      "en": "¿Entonces cuándo se usa \"Quiero\"?",
      "zh": "原來如此！\n那什麼時候才能用「Quiero」？"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 20.379,
      "end": 23.079,
      "en": "Para deseos personales o amor,",
      "zh": "用在表達個人願望或愛意時，"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 23.079,
      "end": 26.199,
      "en": "como \"Quiero viajar\" o \"Te quiero\".",
      "zh": "用在表達個人願望或愛意時，\n比如「我想去旅行」或「我愛你」。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 26.859,
      "end": 28.039,
      "en": "¡Nunca para un servicio!",
      "zh": "在享受店家服務時絕對不能這樣用！"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 28.039,
      "end": 30.96,
      "en": "¡Tiene sentido!",
      "zh": "有道理！"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 30.96,
      "end": 32.719,
      "en": "¿Cómo pido el café como un local?",
      "zh": "有道理！\n那當地人都是怎麼點咖啡的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 33.88,
      "end": 34.899,
      "en": "Dices:",
      "zh": "你可以說："
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 34.899,
      "end": 37.28,
      "en": "\"¿Me pones un café con leche,",
      "zh": "你可以說：\n「可以幫我做一杯拿鐵嗎，"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 37.28,
      "end": 37.679,
      "en": "por favor?",
      "zh": "你可以說：\n「可以幫我做一杯拿鐵嗎，\n謝謝？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 38.32,
      "end": 43.82,
      "en": "¿Y si lo quiero para llevar o tomar en la\nbarra?",
      "zh": "那如果我想外帶，"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 44.52,
      "end": 45.299,
      "en": "Solo añades:",
      "zh": "那如果我想外帶，\n或是留在吧台喝呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 45.299,
      "end": 48.759,
      "en": "\"Para llevar\" o \"En barra,",
      "zh": "只要在後面加上「外帶」或「在吧台喝，"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 48.759,
      "end": 49.479,
      "en": "por favor\".",
      "zh": "只要在後面加上「外帶」或「在吧台喝，\n謝謝」就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 49.979,
      "end": 55.06,
      "en": "¿Me pones un café con leche para llevar?\"",
      "zh": "「可以幫我做一杯拿鐵外帶嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 55.06,
      "end": 55.34,
      "en": "¡Superclaro!",
      "zh": "「可以幫我做一杯拿鐵外帶嗎？」\n太清楚明白了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 55.34,
      "end": 56.679,
      "en": "¡Exacto!",
      "zh": "沒錯，"
    }
  ]
}